# NOTE: .NET build-output rules ([Bb]in/, [Oo]bj/, artifacts/, *.user) moved to
# clavity-dotnet/.gitignore during the monorepo consolidation. They were UNANCHORED
# here and leaked into the Rust tools' src/bin/ dirs, silently dropping real binary
# targets (e.g. clavity-classic/src/bin/fake_tmux.rs). Each product folder now owns
# its own build-output ignore rules.
